senses.gloss:
(1) BAMBUSA BAMBOS DRUCE (Chopra) = B. ARUNDINACEA WILLD.
(Bpn, p. 376; Chopra; Gul; IRM 1, p. 153-154) [= B. ARUNDINACEA
RETZ.] (Dutt; DWH 3, p. 586-592; HK; Kav; KB 4, p. 2724-2727;
Nadk. 1, nr. 307) = B. ARUNDINACEA (Dgv, nr. 341; Vśs) = ARUNDO
BAMBOS LINN.; B. ARUNDINACEA is a name of three distinct species:
a) see 1);
b) B. ORIENTALIS NEES = B. ARUNDINACEA WIGHT EX STEUD.;
c) B. VULGARIS SCHRAD. = B. ARUNDINACEA AIT.;
acc. to Nadk. (1, nr. 307) वंश also designates: B. SPINOSA, APUS
and ORIENTALIS; B. APUS and B. ORIENTALIS are distinct from B.
BAMBOS DRUCE; B. SPINOSA may be meant as a synonym of B. BAMBOS
DRUCE or as the name of a distinct species:
a) B. BAMBOS DRUCE = B. SPINOSA NEES = B. SPINOSA BUCH.-
HAM.;
b) B. SPINOSA ROXB.;
(2) ? B. SPINOSA ROXB., (Nadk. 1, nr. 307);
(3) B. APUS SCHULT. F. (Nadk. 1, nr. 307);
(4) B. ORIENTALIS NEES (Nadk. 1, nr. 307);
(5) DENDROCALAMUS STRICTUS NEES (IRM 3, p. 33-34; KB 4, p.
2728-2729; V 7, p. 54);
(6) SACCHARUM OFFICINARUM LINN. (KB 4, p. 2662-2664; MW; PW;
Vśs);
(7) SHOREA ROBUSTA GAERTN.F. (KB 1, p. 288-290; MW; PW; Vśs).

